# =============================================================================
# DEFAULT-DENY. Everything is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
#
# This repo (arielsacerdoti/suono-e-silenzio) is PUBLIC. Until 2026-10-11 its
# root was the entire user profile (C:\Users\sacer), which is why this file is
# default-deny; it now lives in C:\Users\sacer\Projects\suono-e-silenzio and
# holds only the website. Default-deny stays: a denylist only protects what
# someone remembered to list, and forgetting one line means publishing it.
#
# To track something new, add an explicit `!` line for it. That extra step is
# the point: publishing becomes deliberate rather than accidental.
# =============================================================================

# Ignore everything at the root.
/*

# ── The suono-e-silenzio website — what this repo is actually for ────────────
!/.gitignore
!/about.html
!/contact.html
!/dana.html
!/index.html
!/resources.html
!/sessions.html
!/css/
!/data/
!/images/
!/js/
!/lang/

# The AlphaPicks dashboard was tracked here until 2026-10-11; it moved to its own
# PRIVATE repo (arielsacerdoti/alphapicks-dashboard) and was purged from this
# repo's history, because an API key hardcoded in it had been public here.
# Never add personal, financial or business files to this repo.
